From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 16:22:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add choice action mode (generic_choice agent)

The model picks one entry from the numbered candidate action list instead of
writing the action. Works with screenshot, html/a11y/json and hybrid views.
- env: Observation.candidates, filled when BENCH_ACTION_MODE=choice
- agent: generic_choice (temperature 0, GBNF grammar, logprobs, second call for TYPE/ANSWER)
- llm client: return logprobs in streaming mode
- run.py: --agent generic_choice with --obs / --obs-image
- offline tests with a fake LLM (not run against a real llama-server yet)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
